   3) Firewall             Configure ufw rules$
   4) DNS                  Configure nameservers$
   5) Auto Updates         Configure automatic updates$
   6) Run All              Execute hardening operations$
   7) Backup               Configure hardn backup$
   8) System Details       View system information$
   9) Logs                 View log file$
$
   0) Exit                 q to quit$
$
    > Option [0-9 or q]: 7$
$
# Info: backup/default$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. hardn.yml keeps the$
# defaults: backups on, in /var/backups/hardn, not made yet.$
$
